The '''Rabbit House''' is a [[Location]] on the outskirts of the {{Zone|Village}} on the [[Hub Island]]. It is home to the different employees of the [[Chocolate Factory]], as well as {{NPCSprite|Hoppity}}.

{{ZoneText}} <!-- yes it's actually empty -->
== Purpose ==
The '''Rabbit House''' is a place where players can find the different employees from the [[Chocolate Factory]]. On the bottom floor of the house, seven different {{NPCSprite|Finance Rabbit}}s and {{NPCSprite|Rabbit Security}} can be found.

During [[Hoppity's Hunt]], {{NPCSprite|Hoppity}} can be found outside the house, who sells different [[Chocolate Rabbits]].

